Data and imagery credits remain the property of their respective owners and are
governed by their own terms of use:

- Camera streams: SkylineWebcams (https://www.skylinewebcams.com) and WorldCam
  (https://worldcam.eu) public listings — this project links out to public pages
  only and does not rehost, proxy or embed protected streams.
- Basemap imagery: Esri World Imagery (Esri, Maxar, Earthstar Geographics, and
  the GIS User Community).
- Air traffic: adsb.fi / adsb.lol community ADS-B networks (Open Database Licence).
- Seismic: U.S. Geological Survey (public domain).
- Weather: Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0) / MET Norway.
- ISS telemetry: wheretheiss.at.
- Radar/satellite overlays: RainViewer, NASA GIBS.
